my office. Chris and I walked out to wait for her by the elevators. I couldn’t talk to Chris.
Immediately, Chloe came walking over with long, purposely strides and the look of a woman
possessed. She’d be a force to be reckoned with when she made partner.
“Well?” she asked, eyes penetrating. “What do we think?”
“We’ll get the work,” I said. I was confident of that. A smile came to her ruby lips,
