“Bonuses are going to be pretty good this year, boys,” she said. We shared smiles and Orla
came walking over with her coat draped over her arm and bag over her shoulder.
“Trent gave me the good news. Sounds like it went well.”
“Well as it could, I think,” she said with a smile. A couple months ago I would have seen her
