Her head whipped around to look at me.
“Really, Caleb, you want to talk about Danny right now?”
My face flushed with anger and I could have grabbed onto her again.
“What about Ally, huh?” she asked. I frowned at her.
“What?”
“Who’s. Ally?”
It was hard to think over the throbbing behind my eyes. I wanted to yell at her to shut up. To
