“What are you talking about?”
The elevator doors pinged open. Nick was already down there, chatting happily with one of
the guards. I jutted my chin toward him, eyes locked with Chris, and Chris gave a nod. After
more congratulations and a decision to go to the bar down the block, Chris intercepted Nick
and walked ahead, letting out an occasional booming laugh at one of Nick’s bad jokes. I
