what started the fight to begin with.
“What do you think he wants?” Orla asked.
“I don’t know.”
“What are you going to do?” she asked again. I felt a pang of annoyance.
“I’m going to go to the four seasons - ”
“With my pictures!” She shouted, voice cracking. Nick and Chris looked over their shoulders.
She turned her head down to the sidewalk and blinked back tears.
I wanted to reach out and take her hand. Instead, I looked over the card and before we could
speak further, I heard the jingle of bells over a door and almost walked straight into the back
