“I need to go. Chris is going to get you home. We’re going to talk when I get back,” I said.
“You have your keys.”
She nodded.
“I’ll text you when I’m on my way back,” I told her. Chris was pulling up an Uber. I checked
my maps. The Four Seasons was about a ten-minute walk from us. We waited outside on the
