loud, but the abruptness of it gave me a jolt.
There was a moment of silence and then a door opened.
“ Ja ?” called a soft voice.
“ Komm her .”
“ Ich füttere Max. ”
“No matter how much control you have over them, Mr. Trent, the child will always come
first. Know that,” Furst said with a sigh and pushed himself up to his feet. “If they don’t, get
