“You are precise in calls. I like this. Nick, he wanders, needs to be brought back too often.”
“Mr. Furst - what you say today - ”
I cut myself off. He waited. Blood was rushing in my ears and my heart was pounding hard. I
had to make a decision. I could play it completely safe, lie, and be sent on my way, or I could
