The Austrian had good taste. I wondered if she liked anything about him other than his
money.
“You need me, Maximilian?” she asked, pausing at the edge of the plush white carpet that
covered most of the living room.
“I think we can trust him, Mädchen.”
Mrs. Furst looked at me, eyes cold and critical.
“If you say so, Master,” she said softly, eyes looking over me from the top of my head to the
